flowchart TB
  Paste[Desktop input] --> Queue[(Persisted queued rows)]
  Browser[Browser POST] --> Queue
  Timer[Desktop three-second timer] --> Drain[Drain selected queued jobs]
  Queue --> Drain
  Drain --> Slots{Paused or no free slots?}
  Slots -->|yes| Wait[Leave queued]
  Slots -->|no| Worker[QRunnable download worker]
  Worker --> Session[Independent database session]
  Worker --> Signals[Qt progress / finished / error signals]
  Signals --> Refresh[Refresh and fill free slots]
  Refresh --> Drain
  WebOnly[Web-only mode] --> NoDrain[No desktop scheduler]
